  <item>
    <title>星巴克中国：咖啡帝国倒闭中</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cdba6de924d4525a677c1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cdba6de924d4525a677c1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客所讨论的主题来自于几个月前星巴克新天地店闭店的新闻，是一期对“星巴克”的不正经商业评论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家下班后收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐻</span><strong><span>Show Notes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a>——一切来自于星巴克新天地店闭店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a>——如果星巴克被打包出售给国内运营，将会发生什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">08:57</a>——两位主播为星巴克认真出谋划策：让罗永浩成为代言人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a>——星巴克到底怎么走到这步的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a>——星巴克的定位与历史滤镜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a>——星巴克里的“第三空间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a>——星巴克变成wework的平替</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a>——历史上曾经非常成功的“第三空间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a>——酒肆作为“第三空间”曾经在宋朝繁荣的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a>——“酒让人迷糊，觉得什么都好；咖啡让人清醒，开始自我批判。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a>——星巴克为什么难喝？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">40:22</a>——“星巴克可以好喝，但它选择了难喝”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a>——星巴克衰落的最大原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a>——咖啡届甄嬛传：“Manner＝沈眉庄，瑞幸＝甄嬛，M Stand＝端妃，库迪你是余莺儿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3367">56:07</a>——幸运咖是隐藏boss“四阿哥”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3520">58:40</a>——“美式变成河南式”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3598">59:58</a>——🤭欢迎收听上期知道到底为什么河南人是全中国人的爹</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🐻本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>推拿熊：一个咖啡师兼赛博女工</span></p><span></span><p><span>孢子：南油批发市场档口的一枚小妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐻</span><strong><span>关注我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@推拿熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：开心胡萝卜食品店</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：推拿熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐻</span></p><span></span><p><span>想加听友群的友友可以添加微信：happycarrotshop</span></p>]]></description>
