  <item>
    <title>科学吐槽2025春节档</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b2d7ff606e5c5940f6a2a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b2d7ff606e5c5940f6a2a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Feb 2025 06:59:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于赶在春节档结束之前剪出来了，本期播客是之前《科学吐槽2024中国电影票房》上下集的衍生</span></p><span></span><p><span>原链接指路：👇🏻</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6784fc081bf3f0ab2bd8fcfc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6784fc081bf3f0ab2bd8fcfc"><span>科学吐槽2024中国电影票房（上）</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/678d26ed9420ede9d131d23b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/678d26ed9420ede9d131d23b"><span>科学吐槽2024中国电影票房（下）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>对2025年的春节档电影做了归纳总结和新的吐槽。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容比较多，涵盖了春节档四部热门电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家下班后收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐻</span><strong><span>Show Notes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a>——《哪吒2》：动画电影的故事，其实很难讲好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a>——《哪吒2》：反美的隐喻是不是观众过度联想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a>——《哪吒2》：观看哪吒2已经成为一种爱国行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a>——《哪吒2》：讲各地方言的海鲜让配角角色更加丰满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a>——《哪吒2》：申公豹——“一款小镇做题家”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1407">23:27</a>——《唐探1900》：配角的“立不住”在侧面印证了资产阶级的局限？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a>——《唐探1900》：吃点陈思诚自己最擅长的爱国饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>——《唐探1900》：唐探的时效性和选角巧合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">33:48</a>——《封神2》：封神扑街的一大原因是短板太短</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2181">36:21</a>——《封神2》：合理怀疑乌尔善被美国特效组诈骗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a>——《封神2》：原本可以高光的邓婵玉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2673">44:33</a>——“一个好的作品，能够激发很多同人创作”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2851">47:31</a>——《封神2》：封神演义是那个时代人的三体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a>——《射雕》：徐克的怀旧视听语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3119">51:59</a>——《射雕》：射雕故事里的侠之大者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a>——《射雕》：射雕的直给很难做得有趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3454">57:34</a>——2025春节档电影总结：各种题材的很燃很炸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3495">58:15</a>——2025春节档电影总结：主旋律电影得给出新的角度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">58:58</a>——2025春节档电影总结：剧作上有同质化的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a>——2025春节档电影总结：反复的正邪反转以及演员角色的重复</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3827">63:47</a>——今年的春节档是一剂强心剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3985">66:25</a>——希望大家能记住大荧幕带来的快感</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐻</span><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>推拿熊：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一个咖啡师兼赛博女工</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>孢子：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>南油批发市场档口的一枚小妹</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小菲：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>前好莱坞大厂从业人员，一年为中国电影贡献5000人民币的资深电影爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜鱼偲</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐻</span><strong><span>关注我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@推拿熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：开心胡萝卜食品店</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：推拿熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐻</span></p><span></span><p><span>想加听友群的友友可以添加微信：happycarrotshop</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65506689f525d4d8bd86ff6f/lmS5vUKQtic0YJ8VZEEAHyH9qpGT.m4a" length="67047766" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2HpuURRM0LckLum3QjnpcwD0mp.png"/>
